  "description": "A database- and ORM-agnostic relational query model: an entity/field/foreign-key schema, a serializable query AST (joins, aggregates, grouping, having, sorting, paging) and a fluent builder. Values travel as data and no SQL text is ever emitted, so every backend renders the same query in its own dialect.",
